est-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e164a7079-48a6-4260-ae28-a254ca71a758\u003cbr\u003e\n6cec31c7-fb78-40ea-ad70-c96eb894379b\u003cbr\u003e\n65cf528f-dbb3-4205-a97e-f1d3361258df\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490926-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490926-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis affects multiple existing Grok Bots, not only one conversation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Mode is Active.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsage/tokens are available.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe local Windows computer is connected.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Grok Bot Agent Computer has already been reset and appears reachable, but Bots still do not respond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI also fully quit and reopened the desktop app.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease check the account-side Grok Bot runner / shared Agent Computer state and recover or reprovision it on the backend if necessary.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease preserve my existing Bots, conversations, configurations, project files, and cloud computer data if possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do not ask me to repeatedly reset the Agent Computer because the reset has already been completed and did not resolve the issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490926-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490926-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T15:44:38.885Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":25.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171626,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-47-0-bot-not-responding-after-agent-computer-reset-please-check-backend-runner-agent-computer","display_username":"looker dakidaki","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137743,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-47-0-bot-not-responding-after-agent-computer-reset-please-check-backend-runner-agent-computer/171626/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":491006,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T15:45:12.155Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/looker_dakidaki\"\u003e@looker_dakidaki\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the detailed report, and sorry for the confusion here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour Agent Computer is healthy and nothing is stuck on our side. Your bots, conversations, configurations and computer data are all intact, and the reset you ran did not remove anything. Please don’t reset again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat actually happened is that your account reached its weekly included Grok Bot usage limit. Since then every message you send is being declined, and the app should be showing you a clear notice about that instead of just staying silent. It isn’t, and we’re fixing that. The usage you see as available on \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com\"\u003ecursor.com\u003c/a\u003e is your Cursor plan usage, which is a separate pool from Grok Bot usage. Grok Bot Settings → Usage is the place to check the Grok Bot pool.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’d like to keep working before then, you can turn on on-demand usage for this same account at \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard\u003c/a\u003e, which lets Grok Bot continue past the included amount.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T15:45:12.155Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171626,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-47-0-bot-not-responding-after-agent-computer-reset-please-check-backend-runner-agent-computer","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"AI Coding Agent for Building Ambitious Software | Cursor","clicks":0},{"url":"http://cursor.com/dashboard","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-47-0-bot-not-responding-after-agent-computer-reset-please-check-backend-runner-agent-computer/171626/6","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"curr